{
 "context": {},
 "contract": "TOML 1.0.0",
 "entry": "tomllib.loads",
 "format": 1,
 "notes": ["The input is the text of one file. The entry point takes that text. A reader that takes bytes gets the UTF-8 bytes of the text.","The entry point is the TOML reader of the Python standard library. No product code reads TOML yet.","An accepted vector is a text that the entry point reads. value is the table that it gives.","A refused vector is a text for which the entry point raises TOMLDecodeError. No vector holds the message.","A date-time in value is an object with one key and the value null. The key is the kind of the date-time: offset date-time, local date-time, local date or local time. TOML has no null, so no table of a text has that form. No vector holds a part of the value of a date-time.","A float that is not finite is a $float marker. The sign of a zero is a part of a float: compare 0.0 and -0.0 as two values.","No vector holds a form that TOML 1.1 added, an integer outside 64 bits, a float whose text is outside the range of a float or a text with more than 8 levels. A reader of a file kind refuses each one."],
 "surface": "tomlfile.syntax",
 "vectors": [
  {"id":"empty","input":{"text":""},"result":"accepted","value":{}},
  {"id":"line-end-only","input":{"text":"\n"},"result":"accepted","value":{}},
  {"id":"comment-only","input":{"text":"# a comment\n"},"result":"accepted","value":{}},
  {"id":"no-final-line-end","input":{"text":"a = 1"},"result":"accepted","value":{"a":1}},
  {"id":"line-ends-cr-lf","input":{"text":"a = 1\r\nb = 2\r\n"},"result":"accepted","value":{"a":1,"b":2}},
  {"id":"keys-not-in-sorted-order","input":{"text":"zeta = 1\nalpha = 2\nmiddle = 3\n"},"result":"accepted","value":{"alpha":2,"middle":3,"zeta":1}},
  {"id":"key-forms","input":{"text":"bare-key_1 = 1\n\"quoted key\" = 2\n'literal.key' = 3\n\"\" = 4\n1 = 5\n"},"result":"accepted","value":{"":4,"1":5,"bare-key_1":1,"literal.key":3,"quoted key":2}},
  {"id":"dotted-keys","input":{"text":"a.b.c = 1\na.b.d = 2\na.e = 3\n"},"result":"accepted","value":{"a":{"b":{"c":1,"d":2},"e":3}}},
